WEBVTT

1
00:00:22,540 --> 00:00:25,940
There are anesthetics, surgical instruments, scalpels, and film-taking equipment here.

2
00:00:25,940 --> 00:00:28,940
They are all medically exhausted. They will definitely be needed in emergencies in the future.

3
00:00:29,440 --> 00:00:31,240
These devices may not be available now

4
00:00:31,240 --> 00:00:33,440
But in the end of the world, no materials can be wasted

5
00:00:33,440 --> 00:00:36,852
Bags and sugar

6
00:00:36,852 --> 00:00:50,500
We can make our own milk tea in the future
